    "updated_at": "2022-11-05T20:54:08Z",
    "body": "Having the same issue here. As a temporary fix I have removed the alias that awsume recommends in favor of a hacky function.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunction awsume() {\r\n  . awsume $1\r\n  export  AWSUME_EXPIRATION=$AWSUME_EXPIRATION+00:00\r\n}\r\n```",
